# Model routing (Pelbu)

## Truth

Cursor **rules cannot change the chat model**. Model selection is only:

1. Chat / Agent model dropdown → **`GLM-5.2`**
2. Cursor Settings → Models (custom model + OpenAI Base URL override)

## Intended usage for this repo

| Chat purpose | Select in picker |
|--------------|------------------|
| Bulk implement (UI, forms, polish) | **`GLM-5.2`** |
| Architect / schema / review / hard bugs | Cursor default (Composer / Claude / GPT) — **turn off** OpenAI Base URL override first |

## z.ai setup checklist (must match)

- Custom model name: **`GLM-5.2`** (uppercase)
- Override OpenAI Base URL: **`https://api.z.ai/api/coding/paas/v4`**
- API key: Z.AI key (Coding Plan), not OpenRouter
- After adding: pick **`GLM-5.2`** once in the Agent model menu so new implementer chats stick to it

## Agents / Task tool

Background Task subagents **cannot** use `GLM-5.2` — only Cursor’s allowlisted models. Use a **second chat** with GLM selected instead.
